wiki.com/index.php?title=Item:Tyrzza%26&amp;action=edit#editform#39;s_Bane_(old_version)\"><span class=\"edit-link\" style=\"display: inherit;\" title=\"edit this page\">edit this page</span></a></span> and remove this template.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\"Tyrzza.27s_Bane\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tyrzza's_Bane\">Tyrzza's Bane</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #CCFF99 solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#CCFF99;--bg-color-1-dark:#3D5F1A;--bg-color-2:#EEFFCC;--bg-color-2-dark:#272F17;--header-color:#CCFF99;--header-color-dark:#3D5F1A;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99; width: 15%;\">Proficiency Class\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC; width: 42.5%;\">Martial Weapon Proficiency\n</td>\n<th class=\"bg-color-2\" rowspan=\"19\" style=\"background:#EEFFCC;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Tyrzzas_Bane_Old_Held.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Tyrzzas_Bane_Old_Held.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"1086\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Accepts Sentience?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Damage and Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">1d6 + 4 Pierce, Good, Cold Iron, Magic\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\"><a href=\"/page/Threat_range\" title=\"Threat range\">Critical threat range</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\">18-20 / x2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #CCFF99;\">Weapon Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEFFCC;\"><b><